@startuml
title When the mount belongs to the previous session

participant Host
participant "Self-powered device" as device
participant "USB stack" as stack
participant Charger

Host -> stack: enumerates and configures
stack -> device: mount callback
note over stack: tud_mounted() = true

Host -x stack: cable removed
note over device,stack
  The device remains powered.
  The unplug event does not reach the stack.
end note

Charger -> device: VBUS present
device -> stack: reads state
stack --> device: mounted still true
note over device
  The state is valid in memory,
  but not for the current session.
end note
@enduml
